---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout
 title="Privacy Policy | Stimmie's Guides"
 description="How Stimmie's Guides handles visitor data, analytics, and third-party services."
>
 <main id="main" class="shell shell-legal"><div class="legal-page">
 <a href="/" class="back-link"><Icon name="left" size={16} /> All guides</a>

 <header class="legal-header">
 <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
 <p class="legal-lede">
 Last updated: November 1, 2026. Stimmie's Guides is a personal student-resource site
 operated by Stimmie. It is <strong>not</strong> an official University of the
 Philippines Los Baños (UPLB) website.
 </p>
 </header>

 <article class="legal-body">
 <section>
 <h2>What this site is</h2>
 <p>
 This site hosts free guides and handbooks for students. There are no user
 accounts, logins, or comment forms. You can read everything without signing up.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section>
 <h2>Information we may process</h2>
 <ul>
 <li>
 <strong>Visitor counter.</strong> A lightweight counter (via abacus.jasoncameron.dev)
 records aggregate page visits per guide. Your browser may store a local date stamp
 so repeat views on the same day are not double-counted.
 </li>
 <li>
 <strong>Embedded Google Docs.</strong> Each guide is a Google Doc shown inside the page.
 Google may set cookies and collect usage data when the document loads, under
 <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's privacy policy</a>.
 </li>
 <li>
 <strong>Advertising.</strong> The site loads the Google AdSense script. Google and its
 partners may use cookies to show and measure ads. You can manage this in
 <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's ad settings</a>.
 </li>
 <li>
 <strong>Hosting logs.</strong> Cloudflare, which hosts the site, may log standard
 request metadata (IP address, user agent, timestamps) for security and reliability.
 </li>
 </ul>
 </section>

 <section>
 <h2>What we do not do</h2>
 <ul>
 <li>We do not sell personal data.</li>
 <li>We do not require accounts or collect passwords on this site.</li>
 <li>We do not run our own analytics beyond the visitor counter above.</li>
 </ul>
 </section>

 <section>
 <h2>Third-party links</h2>
 <p>
 Guides may link to external sites (campus systems, tools, social pages). Those
 services have their own privacy policies.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section>
 <h2>Contact</h2>
 <p>
 Questions about this policy? Reach out via
 <a href="https://stimmie.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">stimmie.dev</a>.
 </p>
 </section>
 </article>
 </div></main>
</Layout>

